      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Jifule Fortress, located here in the Feryana\r\nWilderness, has been occupied by the Orcs\r\nnumerous times, but we have always\r\nmanaged to reclaim it.",
        "Jp" : "ここ《フェルヤナ荒原》にあるジフール砦――\r\n幾度となくオーク達に占領されてきたが\r\nその度に取り返してきた"
