      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If the power of foreign Arisen is added there,\r\nthere will be nothing to fear!\r\nTruly, you lot are all reliable fellows.",
        "Jp" : "そこに異国の覚者の力が加われば\r\n怖いものなしだな！\r\n――本当に、頼りになる存在だよ、お前たちは"
